{"title":"Jul 31 — Seoul → Jeju","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Jul 31 — Seoul → Jeju"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Friday · July 31, 2026 · Day 6 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Seoul → Jeju ✈️🌊</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Seoul → Jeju Airport · Dongmun Market · <strong>Hotel:</strong> Shilla Stay Jeju Airport</div>\n  <div class=\"pending-badge\">🔧 Needs Fixes</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-jul31\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-jul31').setView([33.4600, 126.4000], 11);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n  var pts = [\n    { name:'Jeju International Airport ✈️', lat:33.5113, lng:126.4930, c:'#795548', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jeju+International+Airport' },\n    { name:'Jeju One Car Rental 🚗 (Booked)', lat:33.5100, lng:126.4940, c:'#C62828', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jeju+One+Car+rental' },\n    { name:'Shilla Stay Jeju Airport 🏨', lat:33.48580289503151, lng:126.49091012883574, hotel:true, url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shilla+Stay+Jeju+Airport' },\n    { name:'Dongmun Market 🛒', lat:33.51163406327469, lng:126.5262724931184, c:'#43A047', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dongmun+Market+Jeju' },\n    { name:'Badang-Gil Abalone Soup 🐚', lat:33.40986694917806, lng:126.25876309140342, c:'#C62828', url:'https://share.google/LXFNUJ6QB8Rc93dcA' },\n  ];\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    var m = L.marker([p.lat, p.lng], { icon: p.hotel ? hotelDot() : dot(p.c) }).addTo(map);\n    var html = '<b>' + p.name + '</b>';\n    if (p.url) html += '<br><a href=\"' + p.url + '\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Open in Maps →</a>';\n    m.bindPopup(html);\n    window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: m, lat: p.lat, lng: p.lng });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Morning — Check Out</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-07-31T09:00\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">09:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag transport\">🧳 Checkout</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Check Out of Shilla Stay Seodaemun</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Luggage storage available at the hotel if you want to explore Seoul before heading to the airport. Pick up luggage on the way to Gimpo/Gimhae.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shilla+Stay+Seodaemun+Seoul+Station\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Hotel</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/쉐라톤스테이서울역\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Flight</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card transport\" data-dt=\"2026-07-31T13:15\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">13:15</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag transport\">✈️ Departure</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Depart Seoul → Jeju</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">~55 min flight. Depart from Gimpo (GMP) — check your ticket. Arrive at Jeju International Airport (CJU).</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gimpo+International+Airport+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Gimpo Airport</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/김포공항\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card transport\" data-dt=\"2026-07-31T14:30\" data-lat=\"33.5113\" data-lng=\"126.4930\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">14:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag transport\">🛬 Arrival</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Arrive Jeju International Airport</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\"></div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jeju+International+Airport\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 CJU Airport</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/제주국제공항\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-07-31T15:00\" data-lat=\"33.5100\" data-lng=\"126.4940\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">15:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag booked\">BOOKED ✓</span><span class=\"tag transport\">🚗 Car Rental</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Pick Up Rental Car — Jeju One Car</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Having a car is essential in Jeju. The island's best spots are not reachable by public transport. Jeju One Car pick-up near the airport.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jeju+One+Car+rental\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Jeju One Car</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/제주원카렌트\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card activity\" data-dt=\"2026-07-31T16:00\" data-lat=\"33.48580289503151\" data-lng=\"126.49091012883574\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">16:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🏨 Check-in</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Check In — Shilla Stay Jeju Airport</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Jeju base for 4 nights (Jul 31–Aug 3). Located near Jeju International Airport.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shilla+Stay+Jeju+Airport\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Shilla Stay Jeju Airport</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/쉴라스테이+제주공항\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Evening</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card evening\" data-dt=\"2026-07-31T18:00\" data-lat=\"33.48580289503151\" data-lng=\"126.49091012883574\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">18:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🌆 Explore</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Explore Around Shilla Stay Jeju Airport</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Easy first evening — settle in and explore the neighbourhood around the hotel. Plenty of restaurants, cafes, and convenience stores within walking distance. A low-key start before the big Jeju adventures begin.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shilla+Stay+Jeju+Airport\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Shilla Stay Area</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/쉴라스테이+제주공항+주변\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-07-31T19:30\" data-lat=\"33.40986694917806\" data-lng=\"126.25876309140342\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">19:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🐚 Save for Later</span><span class=\"tag note\" style=\"background:#FFF3E0;color:#E65100;border-color:#FFB74D\">⚠️ Closed by Arrival</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Badang-Gil — Abalone Soup (전복죽)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Jeju is famous for its abalone. Jeonbok-juk (abalone porridge) or abalone soup is a must-try on the island. Rich, oceanic, luxurious.<br>🚗 <strong>~35 min drive</strong> from Shilla Stay Jeju Airport.<br>⚠️ <strong>Hours: 8:00 AM – 3:00 PM</strong> — we won't make it on arrival day. Save this for another morning during the Jeju stay.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://share.google/LXFNUJ6QB8Rc93dcA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/바당길+전복+제주\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>Jeju tip:</strong> The car rental is essential — most scenic spots are 30–60 min drive from the city. Fill up the tank when you can, fewer stations outside the city. <strong>Set early alarms</strong> — Seongsan sunrise is tomorrow!</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Friday · July 31, 2026 · Day 6 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Seoul → Jeju ✈️🌊</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Seoul → Jeju Airport · Dongmun Market · <strong>Hotel:</strong> Shilla Stay Jeju Airport</div>\n  <div class=\"pending-badge\">🔧 Needs Fixes</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-jul31\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-jul31').setView([33.4600, 126.4000], 11);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.